{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/63","id":696525577,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0Njk2NTI1NTc3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/63","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/63.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/63.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/63","number":63,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Added communication between Serve and CLI using KV table ","user":{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The in-memory `clientsPolling` map is only available from the Headscale process serving the API. This means that some changes performed by the CLI (which is a different process) are not propagated immediately to the polling clients. \r\n\r\nThis is what is happening in #52. Nodes are successfully removed from the DB, but the connected machines do not receive an updated node `Map` until their client decides to close the long poll and reconnect. \r\n\r\nI have added a new worker that polls the KV table we had since the beginning in Headscale DB schema. Namespaces whose nodes should be sent an updated map are added to the `namespaces_pending_updates` key. \r\n\r\nThe hardcoded polling time is 5000 msecs. ","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:05:49Z","updated_at":"2021-08-26T18:57:15Z","closed_at":"2021-08-03T18:30:33Z","merged_at":"2021-08-03T18:30:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"6091373b5340cb06f8dee3b8e2cd86e93e6e2ae4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"cure","id":149135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTEzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure","html_url":"https://github.com/cure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/63/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/63/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/63/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/statuses/461a893ee44349540bc2e4bb3e76154ff23cbc68","head":{"label":"juanfont:use-kv-for-updates","ref":"use-kv-for-updates","sha":"461a893ee44349540bc2e4bb3e76154ff23cbc68","user":{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1O